// Title: Uncommon Child Process Of AddinUtil.EXE
// Rule ID: b5746143-59d6-4603-8d06-acbd60e166ee
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1218
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
